  "description": "1970s, America. A lonely stretch of highway. Hitchhiker Jack thumbs a ride from a trucker named Stew. \n\nThey’re headed the same way, so why not ride together? But the farther they drive, the creepier Stew gets. He’s clearly done this before, and Jack looks like easy prey. \n\nThen the tables turn. \n\nStew was never the hunter. From the moment Jack climbed into that cab, Stew was the one being hunted. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: The fourth and final story in CNC Revolution's XXL Danpyeonseon (XXL 단편선) Collection.*",
